    ///
    /// Checks:
    /// 1. Execution is happening via [`delegate_call`][delegate_call] (checked
    ///    via `!self.is_logic()`).
    /// 2. The caller is a valid [ERC-1967] proxy (implementation slot is
    ///    non-zero).
