        //     ≤ 2**(e-3-log2(3))
        //     ≤ 2**(e-4.5)
        //
        // For the following iterations, we use the fact that, 2**(e-1) ≤
        // sqrt(a) ≤ x_n: ε_{n+1} = ε_n² / | (2 * x_n) |
