//! [ERC-3156].
//!
//! Adds the [`IErc3156FlashLender::flash_loan`] method, which provides flash
//! loan support at the token level. By default there is no fee, but this can be
//! changed by overriding [`IErc3156FlashLender::flash_loan`].
